cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use WordTangible in your research, please cite it as below, and
  please also cite the underlying rating datasets (see the README
  references): Brysbaert et al. (2014), Muraki et al. (2023), Scott et
  al. (2019), and Coltheart (1981) / Wilson (1988).
title: "WordTangible: word concreteness and imageability analysis"
type: software
authors:
